      "reason": "The first obstruction is that an admissible geometric datum is undefined. The sketch specifies no lattice, lift map, height, or conditions relating the listed parameters to a covolume. It also gives no definition of either prime-error function. Consequently there is no specified upper or lower covolume bound to compare, and the claimed cancellation cannot be checked."
