      "reason": "The admissibility conditions are missing, so there is no way to verify that a proposed datum realizes m, b, f, H, and T simultaneously. The prime-error functions and their transforms are also undefined, and no estimate is supplied that yields a point in the stated interval where the indicated combination is at most x^(-1000000). The interval alone gives no such bound."
    }
